    "summary": "In your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase), as this unit begins or finishes its move, you may pick 1 **SPACE WOLVES VEHICLE** model from your army 3\" or less from this model:\n\n- It **heals** D3 wounds.\n- Until your next [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) starts, its attacks may ignore any modifiers to their **hit rolls** and **wound rolls**.\n\nA **VEHICLE** model can be picked only once per phase.",
